  "body": "Release 0.26.0. This PR merges the release branch `release/v0.26.0` into `main`.\n\n## Cut line and cut list\nThe maintainer set the cut line at 2026-11-23T19:22Z.\n\nThe cut list:\n- #3701 through PR #3731 (Mach4 tap feed), merged as `6167d30af`.\n- PR #3737 (narrower heavy reach), merged as `73c4fa64b`.\n- PR #3736 (Ooznest WorkBee machine file), merged as `9dfcc7ac2`.\n\nPR #3626 and PR #3549 merged before the cut line.\n\n## What this branch changes\n- `cargo xtask decisions --version 0.26.0`: 130 decision files go into `RECOMMENDED.md` under one `v0.26.0` heading.\n- `RELEASE_NOTES.md`: the 0.26.0 section. \"Breaking\" is first: the project file format goes from version 75 to 78, and the part-off kerf moves to the bar side.\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: 116 rows, one for each behaviour PR merged since v0.25.0, from its `Changelog:` line.\n- `cargo xtask release --version 0.26.0 --no-tag --skip-gate`: the version bump commit. No tag.\n\n## Gate\n- The release gate runs on the cut runner: `cut.yml` stage `gate`, run https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/45253909192.\n- No local release gate ran.\n- The two pixel-snapshot lanes are skipped, by the maintainer's standing decision. The pixel snapshots have no value at a cut.\n- The Windows arms of the per-OS pinned readings are skipped too.\n\n## Process changes\n`PROCESS_VERSION` went from 122 to 145. PROCESS_VERSION bump for #3737 follows after the tag.\n\n## After the gate\n- Do not push to this branch after a green gate.\n- The maintainer merges this PR and starts `cut.yml` stage `tag`.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
